Sign E-AC-3 Atmos objects by default, with the built-in DEE key.

Adds dee_default_signing_key() (the key recovered from the Dolby Encoding
Engine) and makes every E-AC-3 Atmos encode sign with it unless the operator
passes sign-objects=off or a different signing-key=. verify-objects likewise
falls back to the built-in key. The HMAC construction and authenticated layout
are from 01/02; this patch supplies the key and flips the default.
Apply after 01-infomdat-hole and 02-secondary-tag. Includes tests.

